'''Shydopps''' were a [[species]] that inhabited the [[planet]] [[Morak]]. After the fall of the [[Galactic Empire|Empire]], [[Shydopp pirates]] attacked shipments of [[rhydonium]] being delivered to an [[Morak Imperial remnants|Imperial remnant]], as well as [[Din Djarin]] and [[Migs Mayfeld]], who were disguised as members of the remnant.<ref name="Chapter 15: The Believer" /> The Shydopp [[Vorg Alsum]] was a [[prisoner]] of the [[New Republic]].<ref name="Chapter 14">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 14: The Tragedy}}</ref> Another Shydopp served as a [[Starfighter|fighter]] [[pilot]] in [[Gorian Shard]]'s [[Gorian Shard's pirate crew|crew]].<ref name="Chapter 17">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 17: The Apostate}}</ref>

